# Simulation-only controller profile for ArduCopter 4.7.0 (1511f271).
# Source: complete_param_tuned.param, verified against the 2026-09-14 flight log.
# Load after copter.parm and gazebo-x500.parm in a fresh calibration state directory.
# All four Gazebo servo_min/servo_max values MUST also be 1000/2000.
# Physical mass, inertia, thrust and motor lag are still the existing model.
# RC calibration and hardware-specific sensor/board settings are not imported.
# MOT_THST_HOVER is the recording-start value; hover learning remains enabled.

# Frame and motor assignment
FRAME_CLASS          1
FRAME_TYPE           1
SERVO1_FUNCTION      33
SERVO2_FUNCTION      34
SERVO3_FUNCTION      35
SERVO4_FUNCTION      36

# Attitude and position controllers
ATC_ACC_P_MAX        1269.275
ATC_ACC_R_MAX        1076.967
